      "raw_html": "<div class=\"question\" id=\"question-226132\"><div class=\"questionHeader\"><span class=\"questionNumber\">9.</span><span class=\"helpButton\" questionid=\"226132\">?</span></div><div class=\"questionGraphicFrame\"><img class=\"questionGraphic\" src=\"/graphics/q-226132\"/></div><div class=\"questionText\"><p>Consider the vector field <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"238\" jax=\"CHTML\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\" tabindex=\"0\"><mjx-math aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"MJX-TEX\"><mjx-texatom texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-b\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D405 TEX-B\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-texatom><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c3D\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c34\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D465 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mstyle><mjx-mspace style=\"width: 0.167em;\"></mjx-mspace></mjx-mstyle><mjx-texatom texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-b\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D422 TEX-B\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-texatom><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"3\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2B\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"3\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c34\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D466 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mstyle><mjx-mspace style=\"width: 0.167em;\"></mjx-mspace></mjx-mstyle><mjx-texatom texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-b\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D423 TEX-B\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-texatom></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml display=\"inline\" unselectable=\"on\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">F</mi></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\"><mspace width=\"0.167em\"></mspace></mstyle><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">i</mi></mrow><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>y</mi><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\"><mspace width=\"0.167em\"></mspace></mstyle><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">j</mi></mrow></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> and a square <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"239\" jax=\"CHTML\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\" tabindex=\"0\"><mjx-math aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"MJX-TEX\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D436 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml display=\"inline\" unselectable=\"on\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>C</mi></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> with side length <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"240\" jax=\"CHTML\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\" tabindex=\"0\"><mjx-math aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"MJX-TEX\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c36\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml display=\"inline\" unselectable=\"on\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>6</mn></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> centered at <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"241\" jax=\"CHTML\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\" tabindex=\"0\"><mjx-math aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"MJX-TEX\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D442 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2C\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml display=\"inline\" unselectable=\"on\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>O</mi><mo>,</mo></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> as shown above. Calculate the flux of <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"242\" jax=\"CHTML\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\" tabindex=\"0\"><mjx-math aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"MJX-TEX\"><mjx-texatom texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-b\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D405 TEX-B\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-texatom></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml display=\"inline\" unselectable=\"on\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">F</mi></mrow></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> across <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"243\" jax=\"CHTML\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\" tabindex=\"0\"><mjx-math aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"MJX-TEX\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D436 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2E\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml display=\"inline\" unselectable=\"on\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>C</mi><mo>.</mo></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></p>\n<p><em>Hint: You may use the fact that, due to symmetry, the flux is equal across all four sides of the square.</em></p>\n</div><div class=\"answerDetails\"><div class=\"questionDifficulty difficultyModerate\">M</div><span class=\"answerCreated\">Sun, Oct 11th @ 12:10 PM</span><span class=\"answerDetailsSeparator\">|</span><span class=\"timeElpased\">Elapsed: 0:19</span><span class=\"answerResult\"><span style=\"color: green;\">Correct</span></span></div></div>"
    },
    {
      "dom_id": "question-226136",
      "name": null,
      "problem": "![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/multivariable/14123192/assets/9da6bdb9ab5f93d0b0d11dfd60ab2b647380a94ce337c2314ec3504cabafa889.png)\n\nConsider the vector field $F=4x\\,i-3y\\,j$ and a square $C$ with side length $2$ centered at $O,$ as shown above. Calculate the flux of $F$ across $C.$\n\n*Hint: You may use the fact that, due to symmetry, the flux is equal across the vertical sides, and similarly for the horizontal sides.*",
      "worked_solution": "If $F$ is a vector field and $C$ is a piecewise-smooth, simple, closed curve, then the flux of $F$ across $C$ is given by\n\n$$\n{∮}_{C}F\\cdot n\\,\\text{d}s,\n$$\n\nwhere $n$ denotes the outward-pointing unit normal vector to $C.$ In this case, we have\n\n$$\n{∮}_{C}F\\cdot n\\,\\text{d}s={\\int }_{{C}_{1}}F\\cdot {n}_{1}\\,\\text{d}s+{\\int }_{{C}_{2}}F\\cdot {n}_{2}\\,\\text{d}s+{\\int }_{{C}_{3}}F\\cdot {n}_{3}\\,\\text{d}s+{\\int }_{{C}_{4}}F\\cdot {n}_{4}\\,\\text{d}s,\n$$\n\nwhere the sides ${C}_{i}$ and unit vectors ${n}_{i}$ are shown below.\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/multivariable/14123192/assets/1de4c4c55784b4a84a0493a4cc65082c430cadcc39c3d808001b2fd27665e968.png)\n\nWe compute this integral in two stages. \n\n- First, consider the side ${C}_{1}.$ We have that ${n}_{1}=i,$ and therefore,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{{C}_{1}}F\\cdot {n}_{1}\\,\\text{d}s & ={\\int }_{{C}_{1}}(4x\\,i-3y\\,j)\\cdot i\\,\\text{d}s \\\\  & =4{\\int }_{{C}_{1}}x\\,\\text{d}s.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThis is a line integral with respect to arc length, which we can evaluate in the usual way. Parameterizing the side ${C}_{1},$ we have\n\n$$\nr(t)=i+t\\,j,\\,⇒\\,{r}^{′}(t)=j,\\,t\\in [-1,1].\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}4{\\int }_{{C}_{1}}x\\,\\text{d}s & =4{\\int }_{-1}^{1}1\\cdot ||{r}^{′}(t)||\\,\\text{d}t \\\\  & =4{\\int }_{-1}^{1}\\text{d}t \\\\  & =4\\cdot 2 \\\\  & =8.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nBy symmetry, the flux integral across the side ${C}_{3}$ must be the same. Therefore,\n\n$$\n{\\int }_{{C}_{1}}F\\cdot {n}_{1}\\,\\text{d}s={\\int }_{{C}_{3}}F\\cdot {n}_{3}\\,\\text{d}s=8.\n$$\n\n- Next, we consider the side ${C}_{2}.$ We have that ${n}_{2}=j,$ and therefore,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{{C}_{2}}F\\cdot {n}_{2}\\,\\text{d}s & ={\\int }_{{C}_{2}}(4x\\,i-3y\\,j)\\cdot j\\,\\text{d}s \\\\  & =-3{\\int }_{{C}_{2}}y\\,\\text{d}s.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThis is a line integral with respect to arc length, which we can evaluate in the usual way. Parameterizing the side ${C}_{2},$ we have\n\n$$\nr(t)=t\\,i+j,\\,⇒\\,{r}^{′}(t)=i,\\,t\\in [-1,1].\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}-3{\\int }_{{C}_{2}}y\\,\\text{d}s & =-3{\\int }_{-1}^{1}1\\cdot ||{r}^{′}(t)||\\,\\text{d}t \\\\  & =-3{\\int }_{-1}^{1}\\text{d}t \\\\  & =(-3)\\cdot 2 \\\\  & =-6.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nBy symmetry, the flux integral across the side ${C}_{4}$ must be the same. Therefore,\n\n$$\n{\\int }_{{C}_{2}}F\\cdot {n}_{2}\\,\\text{d}s={\\int }_{{C}_{4}}F\\cdot {n}_{4}\\,\\text{d}s=-6.\n$$\n\nFinally, then\n\n$$\n{∮}_{C}F\\cdot n\\,\\text{d}s=2\\cdot 8+2\\cdot (-6)=4.\n$$",
      "calculator_instructions": "",
      "fields": [],
      "problem_field_keys": [],
      "answer_fields_complete": null,
      "result": "Correct",
      "proof_feedback": null,
      "html": "<div id=\"question-226136\" class=\"question\"><div class=\"questionHeader\"><span class=\"questionNumber\">10.</span><span class=\"helpButton\" questionid=\"226136\">?</span></div><div class=\"questionGraphicFrame\"><img class=\"questionGraphic\" src=\"/graphics/q-226136\"></div><div class=\"questionText\"><p>Consider the vector field <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"263\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-texatom texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-b\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D405 TEX-B\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-texatom><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c3D\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c34\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D465 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mstyle><mjx-mspace style=\"width: 0.167em;\"></mjx-mspace></mjx-mstyle><mjx-texatom texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-b\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D422 TEX-B\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-texatom><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"3\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2212\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"3\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c33\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D466 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mstyle><mjx-mspace style=\"width: 0.167em;\"></mjx-mspace></mjx-mstyle><mjx-texatom texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-b\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D423 TEX-B\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-texatom></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">F</mi></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\"><mspace width=\"0.167em\"></mspace></mstyle><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">i</mi></mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>y</mi><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\"><mspace width=\"0.167em\"></mspace></mstyle><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">j</mi></mrow></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> and a square <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"264\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D436 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>C</mi></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> with side length <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"265\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c32\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> centered at <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"266\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D442 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2C\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>O</mi><mo>,</mo></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> as shown above. Calculate the flux of <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"267\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-texatom texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-b\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D405 TEX-B\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-texatom></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"in