 y=\"0\"></use>\n <use transform=\"scale(0.707)\" xlink:href=\"#E8-MJMAIN-34\" x=\"904\" y=\"-213\"></use>\n</g>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E8-MJMAIN-64\" x=\"28024\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E8-MJMATHI-73\" x=\"28580\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E8-MJMAIN-2C\" x=\"29050\" y=\"0\"></use>\n</g>\n</svg></span></p>\n<p>where the sides <span class=\"mjpage\"><svg xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\" width=\"2.461ex\" height=\"2.509ex\" style=\"vertical-align: -0.671ex;\" viewBox=\"0 -791.3 1059.8 1080.4\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" aria-labelledby=\"MathJax-SVG-9-Title\">\n<title id=\"MathJax-SVG-9-Title\">C_i</title>\n<defs aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E9-MJMATHI-43\" d=\"M50 252Q50 367 117 473T286 641T490 704Q580 704 633 653Q642 643 648 636T656 626L657 623Q660 623 684 649Q691 655 699 663T715 679T725 690L740 705H746Q760 705 760 698Q760 694 728 561Q692 422 692 421Q690 416 687 415T669 413H653Q647 419 647 422Q647 423 648 429T650 449T651 481Q651 552 619 605T510 659Q484 659 454 652T382 628T299 572T226 479Q194 422 175 346T156 222Q156 108 232 58Q280 24 350 24Q441 24 512 92T606 240Q610 253 612 255T628 257Q648 257 648 248Q648 243 647 239Q618 132 523 55T319 -22Q206 -22 128 53T50 252Z\"></path>\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E9-MJMATHI-69\" d=\"M184 600Q184 624 203 642T247 661Q265 661 277 649T290 619Q290 596 270 577T226 557Q211 557 198 567T184 600ZM21 287Q21 295 30 318T54 369T98 420T158 442Q197 442 223 419T250 357Q250 340 236 301T196 196T154 83Q149 61 149 51Q149 26 166 26Q175 26 185 29T208 43T235 78T260 137Q263 149 265 151T282 153Q302 153 302 143Q302 135 293 112T268 61T223 11T161 -11Q129 -11 102 10T74 74Q74 91 79 106T122 220Q160 321 166 341T173 380Q173 404 156 404H154Q124 404 99 371T61 287Q60 286 59 284T58 281T56 279T53 278T49 278T41 278H27Q21 284 21 287Z\"></path>\n</defs>\n<g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E9-MJMATHI-43\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use transform=\"scale(0.707)\" xlink:href=\"#E9-MJMATHI-69\" x=\"1011\" y=\"-213\"></use>\n</g>\n</svg></span> and unit vectors <span class=\"mjpage\"><svg xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\" width=\"2.285ex\" height=\"2.009ex\" style=\"vertical-align: -0.671ex;\" viewBox=\"0 -576.1 983.8 865.1\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" aria-labelledby=\"MathJax-SVG-10-Title\">\n<title id=\"MathJax-SVG-10-Title\">\\mathbf n_i</title>\n<defs aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E10-MJMAINB-6E\" d=\"M40 442Q217 450 218 450H224V407L225 365Q233 378 245 391T289 422T362 448Q374 450 398 450Q428 450 448 447T491 434T529 402T551 346Q553 335 554 198V62H623V0H614Q596 3 489 3Q374 3 365 0H356V62H425V194V275Q425 348 416 373T371 399Q326 399 288 370T238 290Q236 281 235 171V62H304V0H295Q277 3 171 3Q64 3 46 0H37V62H106V210V303Q106 353 104 363T91 376Q77 380 50 380H37V442H40Z\"></path>\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E10-MJMATHI-69\" d=\"M184 600Q184 624 203 642T247 661Q265 661 277 649T290 619Q290 596 270 577T226 557Q211 557 198 567T184 600ZM21 287Q21 295 30 318T54 369T98 420T158 442Q197 442 223 419T250 357Q250 340 236 301T196 196T154 83Q149 61 149 51Q149 26 166 26Q175 26 185 29T208 43T235 78T260 137Q263 149 265 151T282 153Q302 153 302 143Q302 135 293 112T268 61T223 11T161 -11Q129 -11 102 10T74 74Q74 91 79 106T122 220Q160 321 166 341T173 380Q173 404 156 404H154Q124 404 99 371T61 287Q60 286 59 284T58 281T56 279T53 278T49 278T41 278H27Q21 284 21 287Z\"></path>\n</defs>\n<g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E10-MJMAINB-6E\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use transform=\"scale(0.707)\" xlink:href=\"#E10-MJMATHI-69\" x=\"904\" y=\"-213\"></use>\n</g>\n</svg></span> are shown below.</p>\n<div id=\"graphic-8550241bbdc42d8ce5e3d1b6f1658d69\" class=\"graphic\"><img src=\"/graphics/8550241bbdc42d8ce5e3d1b6f1658d69\"></div>\n\n<p>We compute this integral in two stages. </p>\n<ul>\n<li>First, consider the side <span class=\"mjpage\"><svg xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\" width=\"3.363ex\" height=\"2.509ex\" style=\"vertical-align: -0.671ex;\" viewBox=\"0 -791.3 1447.9 1080.4\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" aria-labelledby=\"MathJax-SVG-11-Title\">\n<title id=\"MathJax-SVG-11-Title\">C_1.</title>\n<defs aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E11-MJMATHI-43\" d=\"M50 252Q50 367 117 473T286 641T490 704Q580 704 633 653Q642 643 648 636T656 626L657 623Q660 623 684 649Q691 655 699 663T715 679T725 690L740 705H746Q760 705 760 698Q760 694 728 561Q692 422 692 421Q690 416 687 415T669 413H653Q647 419 647 422Q647 423 648 429T650 449T651 481Q651 552 619 605T510 659Q484 659 454 652T382 628T299 572T226 479Q194 422 175 346T156 222Q156 108 232 58Q280 24 350 24Q441 24 512 92T606 240Q610 253 612 255T628 257Q648 257 648 248Q648 243 647 239Q618 132 523 55T319 -22Q206 -22 128 53T50 252Z\"></path>\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E11-MJMAIN-31\" d=\"M213 578L200 573Q186 568 160 563T102 556H83V602H102Q149 604 189 617T245 641T273 663Q275 666 285 666Q294 666 302 660V361L303 61Q310 54 315 52T339 48T401 46H427V0H416Q395 3 257 3Q121 3 100 0H88V46H114Q136 46 152 46T177 47T193 50T201 52T207 57T213 61V578Z\"></path>\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E11-MJMAIN-2E\" d=\"M78 60Q78 84 95 102T138 120Q162 120 180 104T199 61Q199 36 182 18T139 0T96 17T78 60Z\"></path>\n</defs>\n<g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E11-MJMATHI-43\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use transform=\"scale(0.707)\" xlink:href=\"#E11-MJMAIN-31\" x=\"1011\" y=\"-213\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E11-MJMAIN-2E\" x=\"1169\" y=\"0\"></use>\n</g>\n</svg></span> We have that <span class=\"mjpage\"><svg xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\" 