itle>\n<defs aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E7-MJMAINB-6E\" d=\"M40 442Q217 450 218 450H224V407L225 365Q233 378 245 391T289 422T362 448Q374 450 398 450Q428 450 448 447T491 434T529 402T551 346Q553 335 554 198V62H623V0H614Q596 3 489 3Q374 3 365 0H356V62H425V194V275Q425 348 416 373T371 399Q326 399 288 370T238 290Q236 281 235 171V62H304V0H295Q277 3 171 3Q64 3 46 0H37V62H106V210V303Q106 353 104 363T91 376Q77 380 50 380H37V442H40Z\"></path>\n</defs>\n<g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E7-MJMAINB-6E\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\"></use>\n</g>\n</svg></span> denotes the outward-pointing unit normal vector to <span class=\"mjpage\"><svg xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\" width=\"2.413ex\" height=\"2.176ex\" style=\"vertical-align: -0.338ex;\" viewBox=\"0 -791.3 1039 936.9\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" aria-labelledby=\"MathJax-SVG-8-Title\">\n<title id=\"MathJax-SVG-8-Title\">C.</title>\n<defs aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E8-MJMATHI-43\" d=\"M50 252Q50 367 117 473T286 641T490 704Q580 704 633 653Q642 643 648 636T656 626L657 623Q660 623 684 649Q691 655 699 663T715 679T725 690L740 705H746Q760 705 760 698Q760 694 728 561Q692 422 692 421Q690 416 687 415T669 413H653Q647 419 647 422Q647 423 648 429T650 449T651 481Q651 552 619 605T510 659Q484 659 454 652T382 628T299 572T226 479Q194 422 175 346T156 222Q156 108 232 58Q280 24 350 24Q441 24 512 92T606 240Q610 253 612 255T628 257Q648 257 648 248Q648 243 647 239Q618 132 523 55T319 -22Q206 -22 128 53T50 252Z\"></path>\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E8-MJMAIN-2E\" d=\"M78 60Q78 84 95 102T138 120Q162 120 180 104T199 61Q199 36 182 18T139 0T96 17T78 60Z\"></path>\n</defs>\n<g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E8-MJMATHI-43\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E8-MJMAIN-2E\" x=\"760\" y=\"0\"></use>\n</g>\n</svg></span> The symbol <span class=\"mjpage\"><svg xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\" width=\"1.418ex\" height=\"3.176ex\" style=\"vertical-align: -1.005ex;\" viewBox=\"0 -934.9 610.5 1367.4\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" aria-labelledby=\"MathJax-SVG-9-Title\">\n<title id=\"MathJax-SVG-9-Title\">\\oint\\limits</title>\n<defs aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E9-MJSZ1-222E\" d=\"M269 74L256 80Q244 85 227 97T191 128T161 179T148 250Q148 332 199 379T302 433L306 434L307 444Q309 456 313 495T321 553T331 607T345 664T365 712T393 756T431 785T479 804Q481 804 488 804T501 805Q552 802 581 769T610 695Q610 669 594 657T561 645Q542 645 527 658T512 694Q512 705 516 714T526 729T538 737T548 742L552 743Q552 745 545 751T525 762T498 768Q471 768 454 752T427 693T414 626T406 536Q405 530 405 527L397 425L404 422Q410 419 421 413T445 399T470 376T494 345T511 303T518 250Q518 205 502 169T460 112T410 80T364 66L360 65L359 55Q357 38 353 4T346 -43T340 -81T333 -118T326 -148T316 -179T303 -207Q256 -306 169 -306Q119 -306 87 -272T55 -196Q55 -170 71 -158T104 -146Q123 -146 138 -159T153 -195Q153 -206 149 -215T139 -230T127 -238T117 -242L113 -244Q113 -246 119 -251T139 -263T167 -269Q186 -269 199 -260Q231 -241 242 -183T266 33L269 74ZM272 122Q272 156 300 391Q300 392 299 392Q287 392 263 379T213 331T187 249Q187 211 205 180T239 137T272 116V122ZM366 107Q378 107 402 119T453 167T479 249Q479 340 394 383V377Q394 375 394 374T393 371T393 366T392 357T391 342T389 321T386 291T382 251T377 199T369 133Q366 112 366 107Z\"></path>\n</defs>\n<g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E9-MJSZ1-222E\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\"></use>\n</g>\n</svg></span> means integration over the closed curve.</p>\n<p>It's helpful to spend some time understanding where this definition comes from, so let's derive it using the closed curve <span class=\"mjpage\"><svg xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\" width=\"1.766ex\" height=\"2.176ex\" style=\"vertical-align: -0.338ex;\" viewBox=\"0 -791.3 760.5 936.9\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" aria-labelledby=\"MathJax-SVG-10-Title\">\n<title id=\"MathJax-SVG-10-Title\">C</title>\n<defs aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E10-MJMATHI-43\" d=\"M50 252Q50 367 117 473T286 641T490 704Q580 704 633 653Q642 643 648 636T656 626L657 623Q660 623 684 649Q691 655 699 663T715 679T725 690L740 705H746Q760 705 760 698Q760 694 728 561Q692 422 692 421Q690 416 687 415T669 413H653Q647 419 647 422Q647 423 648 429T650 449T651 481Q651 552 619 605T510 659Q484 659 454 652T382 628T299 572T226 479Q194 422 175 346T156 222Q156 108 232 58Q280 24 350 24Q441 24 512 92T606 240Q610 253 612 255T628 257Q648 257 648 248Q648 243 647 239Q618 132 523 55T319 -22Q206 -22 128 53T50 252Z\"></path>\n</defs>\n<g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E10-MJMATHI-43\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\"></use>\n</g>\n</svg></span> below.</p>\n<div id=\"graphic-a83474f589135371e9d8b4711918297a\" class=\"graphic\"><img src=\"/graphics/a83474f589135371e9d8b4711918297a\"></div>\n\n<p>First, we pick a point <span class=\"mjpage\"><svg xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\" width=\"1.745ex\" height=\"2.176ex\" style=\"vertical-align: -0.338ex;\" viewBox=\"0 -791.3 751.5 936.9\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" aria-labelledby=\"MathJax-SVG-11-Title\">\n<title id=\"MathJax-SVG-11-Title\">P</title>\n<defs aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E11-MJMATHI-50\" d=\"M287 628Q287 635 230 637Q206 637 199 638T192 648Q192 649 194 659Q200 679 203 681T397 683Q587 682 600 680Q664 669 707 631T751 530Q751 453 685 389Q616 321 507 303Q500 302 402 301H307L277 182Q247 66 247 59Q247 55 248 54T255 50T272 48T305 46H336Q342 37 342 35Q342 19 335 5Q330 0 319 0Q316 0 282 1T182 2Q120 2 87 2T51 1Q33 1 33 11Q33 13 36 25Q40 41 44 43T67 46Q94 46 127 49Q141 52 146 61Q149 65 218 339T287 628ZM645 554Q645 567 643 575T634 597T609 619T560 635Q553 636 480 637Q463 637 445 637T416 636T404 636Q391 635 386 627Q384 621 367 550T332 412T314 344Q314 342 395 342H407H430Q542 342 590 392Q617 419 631 471T645 554Z\"></path>\n</defs>\n<g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E11-MJMATHI-50\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\"></use>\n</g>\n</svg></span> on <span class=\"mjpage\"><svg xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\" width=\"2.413ex\" height=\"2.176ex\" style=\"vertical-align: -0.338ex;\" viewBox=\"0 -791.3 1039 936.9\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" aria-labelledby=\"MathJax-SVG-12-Title\">\n<title id=\"MathJax-SVG-12-Title\">C.</title>\n<defs aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E12-MJMATHI-43\" d=\"M50 252Q50 367 117 473T286 641T490 704Q580 704 633 653Q642 643 648 636T656 626L657 623Q660 623 684 649Q691 655 699 663T715 679T725 690L740 705H746Q760 705 760 698Q760 694 728 561Q692 422 692 421Q690 416 687 415T669 413H653Q647 419 647 422Q647 423 648 429T650 449T651 481Q651 552 619 605T510 659Q484 659 454 652T382 628T299 572T226 479Q194 422 175 346T156 222Q156 108 232 58Q280 24 350 24Q441 24 512 92T606 240Q610 253 612 255T628 257Q648 257 648 248Q648 243 647 239Q618 132 523 55T319 -22Q206 -22 128 53T50 252Z\"></path>\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E12-MJMAIN-2E\" d=\"M78 60Q78 84 95 102T138 120Q162 120 180 104T199 61Q199 36 182 18T139 0T96 17T78 60Z\"></path>\n</defs>\n<g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E12-MJMATHI-43\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E12-MJMAIN-2E\" x=\"760\" y=\"0\"></use>\n</g>\n</svg></span> At this point, we dra