pan> to <span class=\"mjpage\"><svg xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\" width=\"2.413ex\" height=\"2.176ex\" style=\"vertical-align: -0.338ex;\" viewBox=\"0 -791.3 1039 936.9\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" aria-labelledby=\"MathJax-SVG-15-Title\">\n<title id=\"MathJax-SVG-15-Title\">C.</title>\n<defs aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E15-MJMATHI-43\" d=\"M50 252Q50 367 117 473T286 641T490 704Q580 704 633 653Q642 643 648 636T656 626L657 623Q660 623 684 649Q691 655 699 663T715 679T725 690L740 705H746Q760 705 760 698Q760 694 728 561Q692 422 692 421Q690 416 687 415T669 413H653Q647 419 647 422Q647 423 648 429T650 449T651 481Q651 552 619 605T510 659Q484 659 454 652T382 628T299 572T226 479Q194 422 175 346T156 222Q156 108 232 58Q280 24 350 24Q441 24 512 92T606 240Q610 253 612 255T628 257Q648 257 648 248Q648 243 647 239Q618 132 523 55T319 -22Q206 -22 128 53T50 252Z\"></path>\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E15-MJMAIN-2E\" d=\"M78 60Q78 84 95 102T138 120Q162 120 180 104T199 61Q199 36 182 18T139 0T96 17T78 60Z\"></path>\n</defs>\n<g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E15-MJMATHI-43\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E15-MJMAIN-2E\" x=\"760\" y=\"0\"></use>\n</g>\n</svg></span></p>\n<div id=\"graphic-e4437c120c2740c21a646ce4e06783c4\" class=\"graphic\"><img src=\"/graphics/e4437c120c2740c21a646ce4e06783c4\"></div>\n\n<p>We wish to calculate the flow of <span class=\"mjpage\"><svg xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\" width=\"1.683ex\" height=\"2.176ex\" style=\"vertical-align: -0.338ex;\" viewBox=\"0 -791.3 724.5 936.9\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" aria-labelledby=\"MathJax-SVG-16-Title\">\n<title id=\"MathJax-SVG-16-Title\">\\mathbf F</title>\n<defs aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E16-MJMAINB-46\" d=\"M425 0L228 3Q63 3 51 0H