\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\"></use>\n</g>\n</svg></span> is made up of two components:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><p>a component parallel to <span class=\"mjpage\"><svg xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\" width=\"2.132ex\" height=\"2.009ex\" style=\"vertical-align: -0.671ex;\" viewBox=\"0 -576.1 918 865.1\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" aria-labelledby=\"MathJax-SVG-20-Title\">\n<title id=\"MathJax-SVG-20-Title\">\\mathbf n,</title>\n<defs aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E20-MJMAINB-6E\" d=\"M40 442Q217 450 218 450H224V407L225 365Q233 378 245 391T289 422T362 448Q374 450 398 450Q428 450 448 447T491 434T529 402T551 346Q553 335 554 198V62H623V0H614Q596 3 489 3Q374 3 365 0H356V62H425V194V275Q425 348 416 373T371 399Q326 399 288 370T238 290Q236 281 235 171V62H304V0H295Q277 3 171 3Q64 3 46 0H37V62H106V210V303Q106 353 104 363T91 376Q77 380 50 380H37V442H40Z\"></path>\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E20-MJMAIN-2C\" d=\"M78 35T78 60T94 103T137 121Q165 121 187 96T210 8Q210 -27 201 -60T180 -117T154 -158T130 -185T117 -194Q113 -194 104 -185T95 -172Q95 -168 106 -156T131 -126T157 -76T173 -3V9L172 8Q170 7 167 6T161 3T152 1T140 0Q113 0 96 17Z\"></path>\n</defs>\n<g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E20-MJMAINB-6E\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E20-MJMAIN-2C\" x=\"639\" y=\"0\"></use>\n</g>\n</svg></span> which contributes to the flow of <span class=\"mjpage\"><svg xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\" width=\"1.683ex\" height=\"2.176ex\" style=\"vertical-align: -0.338ex;\" viewBox=\"0 -791.3 724.5 936.9\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" aria-labelledby=\"MathJax-SVG-21-Title\">\n<title id=\"MathJax-SVG-21-Title\">\\mathbf F</title>\n<defs aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E21-MJMAINB-46\" d=\"M425 0L228 3Q63 3 51 0H39V62H147V618H39V680H644V676Q647 670 6