        "dom_id": "step-184955",
        "html": "<div class=\"step\" contentid=\"9521\" id=\"step-184955\" stepid=\"184955\" steptype=\"tutorial\" style=\"display: block\">\n<div class=\"stepHeader\">\n<div class=\"stepName\">\n<a class=\"stepAnchor\" id=\"stepAnchor-184955\" name=\"step-1\">Introduction</a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"helpButton\" stepid=\"184955\">?</div>\n</div>\n<style type=\"text/css\">\n                            .mjpage .MJX-monospace {\n                            font-family: monospace\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage .MJX-sans-serif {\n                            font-family: sans-serif\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage {\n                            display: inline;\n                            font-style: normal;\n                            font-weight: normal;\n                            line-height: normal;\n                            font-size: 100%;\n                            font-size-adjust: none;\n                            text-indent: 0;\n                            text-align: left;\n                            text-transform: none;\n                            letter-spacing: normal;\n                            word-spacing: normal;\n                            word-wrap: normal;\n                            white-space: nowrap;\n                            float: none;\n                            direction: ltr;\n                            max-width: none;\n                            max-height: none;\n                            min-width: 0;\n                            min-height: 0;\n                            border: 0;\n                            padding: 0;\n                            margin: 0\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage * {\n                            transition: none;\n                            -webkit-transition: none;\n                            -moz-transition: none;\n                            -ms-transition: none;\n                            -o-transition: none\n                            }\n\n                            .mjx-svg-href {\n                            fill: blue;\n                            stroke: blue\n                            }\n\n                            .MathJax_SVG_LineBox {\n                            display: table!important\n                            }\n\n                            .MathJax_SVG_LineBox span {\n                            display: table-cell!important;\n                            width: 10000em!important;\n                            min-width: 0;\n                            max-width: none;\n                            padding: 0;\n                            border: 0;\n                            margin: 0\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage__block {\n                            text-align: center;\n                            margin: 1em 0em;\n                            position: relative;\n                            display: block!important;\n                            text-indent: 0;\n                            max-width: none;\n                            max-height: none;\n                            min-width: 0;\n                            min-height: 0;\n                            width: 100%\n                            }</style><p>Let <span class=\"mjpage\"><svg aria-labelledby=\"MathJax-SVG-1-Title\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"2.176ex\" role=\"img\" style=\"vertical-align: -0.338ex;\" viewbox=\"0 -791.3 724.5 936.9\" width=\"1.683ex\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\">\n<title id=\"MathJax-SVG-1-Title\">\\mathbf F</title>\n<defs aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<path d=\"M425 0L228 3Q63 3 51 0H39V62H147V618H39V680H644V676Q647 670 659 552T675 428V424H613Q613 433 605 477Q599 511 589 535T562 574T530 599T488 612T441 617T387 618H368H304V371H333Q389 373 411 390T437 468V488H499V192H437V212Q436 244 430 263T408 292T378 305T333 309H304V62H439V0H425Z\" id=\"E1-MJMAINB-46\" stroke-width=\"1\"></path>\n</defs>\n<g aria-hidden=\"true\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)\">\n<use x=\"0\" xlink:href=\"#E1-MJMAINB-46\" y=\"0\"></use>\n</g>\n</svg></span> be a vector field on <span class=\"mjpage\"><svg aria-labelledby=\"MathJax-SVG-2-Title\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"2.676ex\" role=\"img\" style=\"vertical-align: -0.338ex;\" viewbox=\"0 -1006.6 1176.4 1152.1\" width=\"2.732ex\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\">\n<title id=\"MathJax-SVG-2-Title\">\\mathbb R^2</title>\n<defs aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<path d=\"M17 665Q17 672 28 683H221Q415 681 439 677Q461 673 481 667T516 654T544 639T566 623T584 607T597 592T607 578T614 565T618 554L621 548Q626 530 626 497Q626 447 613 419Q578 348 473 326L455 321Q462 310 473 292T517 226T578 141T637 72T686 35Q705 30 705 16Q705 7 693 -1H510Q503 6 404 159L306 310H268V183Q270 67 271 59Q274 42 291 38Q295 37 319 35Q344 35 353 28Q362 17 353 3L346 -1H28Q16 5 16 16Q16 35 55 35Q96 38 101 52Q106 60 106 341T101 632Q95 645 55 648Q17 648 17 665ZM241 35Q238 42 237 45T235 78T233 163T233 337V621L237 635L244 648H133Q136 641 137 638T139 603T141 517T141 341Q141 131 140 89T134 37Q133 36 133 35H241ZM457 496Q457 540 449 570T425 615T400 634T377 643Q374 643 339 648Q300 648 281 635Q271 628 270 610T268 481V346H284Q327 346 375 352Q421 364 439 392T457 496ZM492 537T492 496T488 427T478 389T469 371T464 361Q464 360 465 360Q469 360 497 370Q593 400 593 495Q593 592 477 630L457 637L461 626Q474 611 488 561Q492 537 492 496ZM464 243Q411 317 410 317Q404 317 401 315Q384 315 370 312H346L526 35H619L606 50Q553 109 464 243Z\" id=\"E2-MJAMS-52\" stroke-width=\"1\"></path>\n<path d=\"M109 429Q82 429 66 447T50 491Q50 562 103 614T235 666Q326 666 387 610T449 465Q449 422 429 383T381 315T301 241Q265 210 201 149L142 93L218 92Q375 92 385 97Q392 99 409 186V189H449V186Q448 183 436 95T421 3V0H50V19V31Q50 38 56 46T86 81Q115 113 136 137Q145 147 170 174T204 211T233 244T261 278T284 308T305 340T320 369T333 401T340 431T343 464Q343 527 309 573T212 619Q179 619 154 602T119 569T109 550Q109 549 114 549Q132 549 151 535T170 489Q170 464 154 447T109 429Z\" id=\"E2-MJMAIN-32\" stroke-width=\"1\"></path>\n</defs>\n<g aria-hidden=\"true\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)\">\n<use x=\"0\" xlink:href=\"#E2-MJAMS-52\" y=\"0\"></use>\n<use transform=\"scale(0.707)\" x=\"1021\" xlink:href=\"#E2-MJMAIN-32\" y=\"581\"></use>\n</g>\n</svg></span> and <span class=\"mjpage\"><svg aria-labelledby=\"MathJax-SVG-3-Title\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"2.176ex\" role=\"img\" style=\"vertical-align: -0.338ex;\" viewbox=\"0 -791.3 760.5 936.9\" width=\"1.766ex\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\">\n<title id=\"MathJax-SVG-3-Title\">C</title>\n<defs aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<path d=\"M50 252Q50 367 117 473T286 641T490 704Q580 704 633 653Q642 643 648 636T656 626L657 623Q660 623 684 649Q691 655 699 663T715 679T725 690L740 705H746Q760 705 760 698Q760 694 728 561Q692 422 692 421Q690 416 687 415T669 413H653Q647 419 647 422Q647 423 648 429T650 449T651 481Q651 552 619 605T510 659Q484 659 454 652T382 628T299 572T226 479Q194 422 175 346T156 222Q156 108 232 58Q280 24 350 24Q441 24 512 92T606 240Q610 253 612 255T628 257Q648 257 648 248Q648 243 647 239Q618 132 523 55T319 -22Q206 -22 128 53T50 252Z\" id=\"E3-MJMATHI-43\" stroke-width=\"1\"></path>\n</defs>\n<g aria-hidden=\"true\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)\">\n<use x=\"0\" xlink:href=\"#E3-MJMATHI-43\" y=\"0\"></use>\n</g>\n</svg></span> be a <em>closed</em> curve in the <span class=\"mjpage\"><svg aria-labelledby=\"MathJax-SVG-4-Title\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"2.009ex\" role=\"img\" style=\"vertical-align: -0.671ex;\" viewbox=\"0 -576.1 1070 865.1\" width=\"2.485ex\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\">\n<title id=\"MathJax-SVG-4-Title\">xy</title>\n<defs aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<path d=\"M52 289Q59 331 106 386T222 442Q257 442 286 424T329 379Q371 442 430 442Q467 442 494 420T522 361Q522 332 508 314T481 292T458 288Q439 288 427 299T415 328Q415 374 465 391Q454 404 425 404Q412 404 406 402Q368 386 350 336Q290 115 290 78Q290 50 306 38T341 26Q378 26 414 59T463 140Q466 150 469 151T485 153H489Q504 153 504 145Q504 144 502 134Q486 77 440 33T333 -11Q263 -11 227 52Q186 -10 133 -10H127Q78 -10 57 16T35 71Q35 103 54 123T99 143Q142 143 142 101Q142 81 130 66T107 46T94 41L91 40Q91 39 97 36T113 29T132 26Q168 26 194 71Q203 87 217 139T245 247T261 313Q266 340 266 352Q266 380 251 392T217 404Q177 404 142 372T93 290Q91 281 88 280T72 278H58Q52 284 52 289Z\" id=\"E4-MJMATHI-78\" stroke-width=\"1\"></path>\n<path d=\"M21 287Q21 301 36 335T84 406T158 442Q199 442 224 419T250 355Q248 336 247 334Q247 331 231 288T198 191T182 105Q182 62 196 45T238 27Q261 27 281 38T312 61T339 94Q339 95 344 114T358 173T377 247Q415 397 419 404Q432 431 462 431Q475 431 483 424T494 412T496 403Q496 390 447 193T391 -23Q363 -106 294 -155T156 -205Q111 -205 77 -183T43 -117Q43 -95 50 -80T69 -58T89 -48T106 -45Q150 -45 150 -87Q150 -107 138 -122T115 -142T102 -147L99 -148Q101 -153 118 -160T152 -167H160Q177 -167 186 -165Q219 -156 247 -127T290 -65T313 -9T321 21L315 17Q309 13 296 6T270 -6Q250 -11 231 -11Q185 -11 150 11T104 82Q103 89 103 113Q103 170 138 262T173 379Q173 380 173 381Q173 390 173 393T169 400T158 404H154Q131 404 112 385T82 344T65 302T57 280Q55 278 41 278H27Q21 284 21 287Z\" id=\"E4-MJMATHI-79\" stroke-width=\"1\"></path>\n</defs>\n<g aria-hidden=\"true\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)\">\n<use x=\"0\" xlink:href=\"#E4-MJMATHI-78\" y=\"0\"></use>\n<use x=\"572\" xlink:href=\"#E4-MJMATHI-79\" y=\"0\"></use>\n</g>\n</svg></span>-plane. Imagine that <span class=\"mjpage\"><svg aria-labelledby=\"MathJax-SVG-5-Title\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"2.176ex\" role=\"img\" style=\"vertical-align: -0.338ex;\" viewbox=\"0 -791.3 724.5 936.9\" width=\"1.683ex\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\">\n<title id=\"MathJax-SVG-5-Title\">\\mathbf F</title>\n<defs aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<path d=\"M425 0L228 3Q63 3 51 0H39V62H147V618H39V680H644V676Q647 670 659 552T675 428V424H613Q613 433 605 477Q599 511 589 535T562 574T530 599T488 612T441 617T387 618H368H304V371H333Q389 373 411 390T437 468V488H499V192H437V212Q436 244 430 263T408 292T378 305T333 309H304V62H439V0H425Z\" id=\"E5-MJMAINB-46\" stroke-width=\"1\"></path>\n</defs>\n<g aria-hidden=\"true\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)\">\n<use x=\"0\" xlink:href=\"#E5-MJMAINB-46\" y=\"0\"></use>\n</g>\n</svg></span> represents the velocity field of a stream of flowing water, and <span class=\"mjpage\"><svg aria-labelledby=\"MathJax-SVG-6-Title\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"2.176ex\" role=\"img\" style=\"vertical-align: -0.338ex;\" viewbox=\"0 -791.3 760.5 936.9\" width=\"1.766ex\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\">\n<title id=\"MathJax-SVG-6-Title\">C</title>\n<defs aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<path d=\"M50 252Q50 367 117 473T286 641T490 704Q580 704 633 653Q642 643 648 636T656 626L657 623Q660 623 684 649Q691 655 699 663T715 679T725 690L740 705H746Q760 705 760 698Q760 694 728 561Q692 422 692 421Q690 416 687 415T669 413H653Q647 419 647 422Q647 423 648 429T650 449T651 481Q651 552 619 605T510 659Q484 659 454 652T382 628T299 572T226 479Q194 422 175 346T156 222Q156 108 232 58Q280 24 350 24Q441 24 512 92T606 240Q610 253 612 255T628 257Q648 257 648 248Q648 243 647 239Q618 132 523 55T319 -22Q206 -22 128 53T50 252Z\" id=\"E6-MJMATHI-43\" stroke-width=\"1\"></path>\n</defs>\n<g aria-hidden=\"true\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)\">\n<use x=\"0\" xlink:href=\"#E6-MJMATHI-43\" y=\"0\"></use>\n</g>\n</svg></span> is a curve that allows water to flow through it (like a fishing net). </p>\n<p>The <strong>flux of <span class=\"mjpage\"><svg aria-labelledby=\"MathJax-SVG-7-Title\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"2.176ex\" role=\"img\" style=\"vertical-align: -0.338ex;\" viewbox=\"0 -791.3 724.5 936.9\" width=\"1.683ex\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\">\n<title id=\"MathJax-SVG-7-Title\">\\mathbf F</title>\n<defs aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<path d=\"M425 0L228 3Q63 3 51 0H39V62H147V618H39V680H644V676Q647 670 659 552T675 428V424H613Q613 433 605 477Q599 511 589 535T562 574T530 599T488 612T441 617T387 618H368H304V371H333Q389 373 411 390T437 468V488H499V192H437V212Q436 244 430 263T408 292T378 305T333 309H304V62H439V0H425Z\" id=\"E7-MJMAINB-46\" stroke-width=\"1\"></path>\n</defs>\n<g aria-hidden=\"true\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)\">\n<use x=\"0\" xlink:href=\"#E7-MJMAINB-46\" y=\"0\"></use>\n</g>\n</svg></span> across <span class=\"mjpage\"><svg aria-labelledby=\"MathJax-SVG-8-Title\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"2.176ex\" role=\"img\" style=\"vertical-align: -0.338ex;\" viewbox=\"0 -791.3 855.5 936.9\" width=\"1.987ex\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\">\n<title id=\"MathJax-SVG-8-Title\">\\boldsymbol C</title>\n<defs aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<path d=\"M380 -17Q335 -17 293 -10T207 16T130 65T76 144T55 256Q55 306 70 361T122 476T211 582T345 663T525 702H545Q673 702 731 634L777 668Q783 672 789 677T800 685T808 691T814 695T818 698T822 700T825 702T828 703T830 703T833 703Q855 703 855 690Q855 686 823 558T789 426Q786 421 782 420T756 419Q734 420 729 421T724 432Q724 434 725 447T726 472Q726 552 678 604Q640 640 586 640H574Q533 640 494 632T409 604T324 541T260 437Q243 397 227 333T210 219Q210 152 237 117Q255 90 299 68T420 46H429Q506 46 580 100T678 234Q683 249 687 251T712 254H723Q743 254 743 240Q743 232 736 213T710 162T663 100T586 40T477 -5Q433 -17 380 -17Z\" id=\"E8-MJMATHBI-43\" stroke-width=\"1\"></path>\n</defs>\n<g aria-hidden=\"true\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)\">\n<use x=\"0\" xlink:href=\"#E8-MJMATHBI-43\" y=\"0\"></use>\n</g>\n</svg></span></strong> is a scalar number that tells us how much water is escaping the region bounded by <span class=\"mjpage\"><svg aria-labelledby=\"MathJax-SVG-9-Title\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"2.176ex\" role=\"img\" style=\"vertical-align: -0.338ex;\" viewbox=\"0 -791.3 1039 936.9\" width=\"2.413ex\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\">\n<title id=\"MathJax-SVG-9-Title\">C.</title>\n<defs aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<path d=\"M50 252Q50 367 117 473T286 641T490 704Q580 704 633 653Q642 643 648 636T656 626L657 623Q660 623 684 649Q691 655 699 663T715 679T725 690L740 705H746Q760 705 760 698Q760 694 728 561Q692 422 692 421Q690 416 687 415T669 413H653Q647 419 647 422Q647 423 648 429T650 449T651 481Q651 552 619 605T510 659Q484 659 454 652T382 628T299 572T226 479Q194 422 175 346T156 222Q156 108 232 58Q280 24 350 24Q441 24 512 92T606 240Q610 253 612 255T628 257Q648 257 648 248Q648 243 647 239Q618 132 523 55T319 -22Q206 -22 128 53T50 252Z\" id=\"E9-MJMATHI-43\" stroke-width=\"1\"></path>\n<path d=\"M78 60Q78 84 95 102T138 120Q162 120 180 104T199 61Q199 36 182 18T139 0T96 17T78 60Z\" id=\"E9-MJMAIN-2E\" stroke-width=\"1\"></path>\n</defs>\n<g aria-hidden=\"true\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)\">\n<use x=\"0\" xlink:href=\"#E9-MJMATHI-43\" y=\"0\"></use>\n<use x=\"760\" xlink:href=\"#E9-MJMAIN-2E\" y=\"0\"></use>\n</g>\n</svg></span> </p>\n<p>We have three possible scenarios: </p>\n<ul>\n<li><p>If more water flows out through <span class=\"mjpage\"><svg aria-labelledby=\"MathJax-SVG-10-Title\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"2.176ex\" role=\"img\" style=\"vertical-align: -0.338ex;\" viewbox=\"0 -791.3 760.5 936.9\" width=\"1.766ex\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\">\n<title id=\"MathJax-SVG-10-Title\">C</title>\n<defs aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<path d=\"M50 252Q50 367 117 473T286 641T490 704Q580 704 633 653Q642 643 648 636T656 626L657 623Q660 623 684 649Q691 655 699 663T715 679T725 690L740 705H746Q760 705 760 698Q760 694 728 561Q692 422 692 421Q690 416 687 415T669 413H653Q647 419 647 422Q647 423 648 429T650 449T651 481Q651 552 619 605T510 659Q484 659 454 652T382 628T299 572T226 479Q194 422 175 346T156 222Q156 108 232 58Q280 24 350 24Q441 24 512 92T606 240Q610 253 612 255T628 257Q648 257 648 248Q648 243 647 239Q618 132 523 55T319 -22Q206 -22 128 53T50 252Z\" id=\"E10-MJMATHI-43\" stroke-width=\"1\"></path>\n</defs>\n<g aria-hidden=\"true\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)\">\n<use x=\"0\" xlink:href=\"#E10-MJMATHI-43\" y=\"0\"></use>\n</g>\n</svg></span> than in through <span class=\"mjpage\"><svg aria-labelledby=\"MathJax-SVG-11-Title\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"2.176ex\" role=\"img\" style=\"vertical-align: -0.338ex;\" viewbox=\"0 -791.3 760.5 936.9\" width=\"1.766ex\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\">\n<title id=\"MathJax-SVG-11-Title\">C</title>\n<defs aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<path d=\"M50 252Q50 367 117 473T286 641T490 704Q580 704 633 653Q642 643 648 636T656 626L657 623Q660 623 684 649Q691 655 699 663T715 679T725 690L740 705H746Q760 705 760 698Q760 694 728 561Q692 422 692 421Q690 416 687 415T669 413H653Q647 419 647 422Q647 423 648 429T650 449T651 481Q651 552 619 605T510 659Q484 659 454 652T382 628T299 572T226 479Q194 422 175 346T156 222Q156 108 232 58Q280 24 350 24Q441 24 512 92T606 240Q610 253 612 255T628 257Q648 257 648 248Q648 243 647 239Q618 132 523 55T319 -22Q206 -22 128 53T50 252Z\" id=\"E11-MJMATHI-43\" stroke-width=\"1\"></path>\n</defs>\n<g aria-hidden=\"true\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)\">\n<use x=\"0\" xlink:href=\"#E11-MJMATHI-43\" y=\"0\"></use>\n</g>\n</svg></span> (i.e., there is a net flow <em>out</em> through <span class=\"mjpage\"><svg aria-labelledby=\"MathJax-SVG-12-Title\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"2.176ex\" role=\"img\" style=\"vertical-align: -0.338ex;\" viewbox=\"0 -791.3 760.5 936.9\" width=\"1.766ex\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\">\n<title id=\"MathJax-SVG-12-Title\">C</title>\n<defs aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<path d=\"M50 252Q50 367 117 473T286 641T490 704Q580 704 633 653Q642 643 648 636T656 626L657 623Q660 623 684 649Q691 655 699 663T715 679T725 690L740 705H746Q760 705 760 698Q760 694 728 561Q692 422 692 421Q690 416 687 415T669 413H653Q647 419 647 422Q647 423 648 429T650 449T651 481Q651 552 619 605T510 659Q484 659 454 652T382 628T299 572T226 479Q194 422 175 346T156 222Q156 108 232 58Q280 24 350 24Q441 24 512 92T606 240Q610 253 612 255T628 257Q648 257 648 248Q648 243 647 239Q618 132 523 55T319 -22Q206 -22 128 53T50 252Z\" id=\"E12-MJMATHI-43\" stroke-width=\"1\"></path>\n</defs>\n<g aria-hidden=\"true\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)\">\n<use x=\"0\" xlink:href=\"#E12-MJMATHI-43\" y=\"0\"></use>\n</g>\n</svg></span>), the flux is <em>positive</em>.</p>\n<div class=\"graphic\" id=\"graphic-df9e471bda3b6683a0dd149777d5e3f5\"><img src=\"/graphics/df9e471bda3b6683a0dd149777d5e3f5\"/></div>\n</li>\n<li><p>If more water flows in through <span class=\"mjpage\"><svg aria-labelledby=\"MathJax-SVG-13-Title\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"2.176ex\" role=\"img\" style=\"vertical-align: -0.338ex;\" viewbox=\"0 -791.3 760.5 936.9\" width=\"1.766ex\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\">\n<title id=\"MathJax-SVG-13-Title\">C</title>\n<defs aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<path d=\"M50 252Q50 367 117 473T286 641T490 704Q580 704 633 653Q642 643 648 636T656 626L657 623Q660 623 684 649Q691 655 699 663T715 679T725 690L740 705H746Q760 705 760 698Q760 694 728 561Q692 422 692 421Q690 416 687 415T669 413H653Q647 419 647 422Q647 423 648 429T650 449T651 481Q651 552 619 605T510 659Q484 659 454 652T382 628T299 572T226 479Q194 422 175 346T156 222Q156 108 232 58Q280 24 350 24Q441 24 512 92T606 240Q610 253 612 255T628 257Q648 257 648 248Q648 243 647 239Q618 132 523 55T319 -22Q206 -22 128 53T50 252Z\" id=\"E13-MJMATHI-43\" stroke-width=\"1\"></path>\n</defs>\n<g aria-hidden=\"true\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)\">\n<use x=\"0\" xlink:href=\"#E13-MJMATHI-43\" y=\"0\"></use>\n</g>\n</svg></span> than out through <span class=\"mjpage\"><svg aria-labelledby=\"MathJax-SVG-14-Title\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"2.176ex\" role=\"img\" style=\"vertical-align: -0.338ex;\" viewbox=\"0 -791.3 760.5 936.9\" width=\"1.766ex\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\">\n<title id=\"MathJax-SVG-14-Title\">C</title>\n<defs aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<path d=\"M50 252Q50 367 117 473T286 641T490 704Q580 704 633 653Q642 643 648 636T656 626L657 623Q660 623 684 649Q691 655 699 663T715 679T725 690L740 705H746Q760 705 760 698Q760 694 728 561Q692 422 692 421Q690 416 687 415T669 413H653Q647 419 647 422Q647 423 648 429T650 449T651 481Q651 552 619 605T510 659Q484 659 454 652T382 628T299 572T226 479Q194 422 175 346T156 222Q156 108 232 58Q280 24 350 24Q441 24 512 92T606 240Q610 253 612 255T628 257Q648 257 648 248Q648 243 647 239Q618 132 523 55T319 -22Q206 -22 128 53T50 252Z\" id=\"E14-MJMATHI-43\" stroke-width=\"1\"></path>\n</defs>\n<g aria-hidden=\"true\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)\">\n<use x=\"0\" xlink:href=\"#E14-MJMATHI-43\" y=\"0\"></use>\n</g>\n</svg></span> (i.e., there is a net flow <em>in</em> through <span class=\"mjpage\"><svg aria-labelledby=\"MathJax-SVG-15-Title\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"2.176ex\" role=\"img\" style=\"vertical-align: -0.338ex;\" viewbox=\"0 -791.3 760.5 936.9\" width=\"1.766ex\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\">\n<title id=\"MathJax-SVG-15-Title\">C</title>\n<defs aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<path d=\"M50 252Q50 367 117 473T286 641T490 704Q580 704 633 653Q642 643 648 636T656 626L657 623Q660 623 684 649Q691 655 699 663T715 679T725 690L740 705H746Q760 705 760 698Q760 694 728 561Q692 422 692 421Q690 416 687 415T669 413H653Q647 419 647 422Q647 423 648 429T650 449T651 481Q651 552 619 605T510 659Q484 659 454 652T382 628T299 572T226 479Q194 422 175 346T156 222Q156 108 232 58Q280 24 350 24Q441 24 512 92T606 240Q610 253 612 255T628 257Q648 257 648 248Q648 243 647 239Q618 132 523 55T319 -22Q206 -22 128 53T50 252Z\" id=\"E15-MJMATHI-43\" stroke-width=\"1\"></path>\n</defs>\n<g aria-hidden=\"true\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)\">\n<use x=\"0\" xlink:href=\"#E15-MJMATHI-43\" y=\"0\"></use>\n</g>\n</svg></span>), the flux is <em>negative</em>.</p>\n<div class=\"graphic\" id=\"graphic-e2d5922f878b632f2c86fea0a17b5c2a\"><img src=\"/graphics/e2d5922f878b632f2c86fea0a17b5c2a\"/></div>\n</li>\n<li><p>If the net flow through <span class=\"mjpage\"><svg aria-labelledby=\"MathJax-SVG-16-Title\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"2.176ex\" role=\"img\" style=\"vertical-align: -0.338ex;\" viewbox=\"0 -791.3 760.5 936.9\" width=\"1.766ex\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\">\n<title id=\"MathJax-SVG-16-Title\">C</title>\n<defs aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<path d=\"M50 252Q50 367 117 473T286 641T490 704Q580 704 633 653Q642 643 648 636T656 626L657 623Q660 623 684 649Q691 655 699 663T715 679T725 690L740 705H746Q760 705 760 698Q760 694 728 561Q692 422 692 421Q690 416 687 415T669 413H653Q647 419 647 422Q647 423 648 429T650 449T651 481Q651 552 619 605T510 659Q484 659 454 652T382 628T299 572T226 479Q194 422 175 346T156 222Q156 108 232 58Q280 24 350 24Q441 24 512 92T606 240Q610 253 612 255T628 257Q648 257 648 248Q648 243 647 239Q618 132 523 55T319 -22Q206 -22 128 53T50 252Z\" id=\"E16-MJMATHI-43\" stroke-width=\"1\"></path>\n</defs>\n<g aria-hidden=\"true\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)\">\n<use x=\"0\" xlink:href=\"#E16-MJMATHI-43\" y=\"0\"></use>\n</g>\n</svg></span> is zero, the flux equals zero.</p>\n<p>The following vector field has zero flux across <span class=\"mjpage\"><svg aria-labelledby=\"MathJax-SVG-17-Title\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"2.176ex\" role=\"img\" style=\"vertical-align: -0.338ex;\" viewbox=\"0 -791.3 760.5 936.9\" width=\"1.766ex\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\">\n<title id=\"MathJax-SVG-17-Title\">C</title>\n<defs aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<path d=\"M50 252Q50 367 117 473T286 641T490 704Q580 704 633 653Q642 643 648 636T656 626L657 623Q660 623 684 649Q691 655 699 663T715 679T725 690L740 705H746Q760 705 760 698Q760 694 728 561Q692 422 692 421Q690 416 687 415T669 413H653Q647 419 647 422Q647 423 648 429T650 449T651 481Q651 552 619 605T510 659Q484 659 454 652T382 628T299 572T226 479Q194 422 175 346T156 222Q156 108 232 58Q280 24 350 24Q441 24 512 92T606 240Q610 253 612 255T628 257Q648 257 648 248Q648 243 647 239Q618 132 523 55T319 -22Q206 -22 128 53T50 252Z\" id=\"E17-MJMATHI-43\" stroke-width=\"1\"></path>\n</defs>\n<g aria-hidden=\"true\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)\">\n<use x=\"0\" xlink:href=\"#E17-MJMATHI-43\" y=\"0\"></use>\n</g>\n</svg></span> because the amount of water flowing in through <span class=\"mjpage\"><svg aria-labelledby=\"MathJax-SVG-18-Title\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"2.176ex\" role=\"img\" style=\"vertical-align: -0.338ex;\" viewbox=\"0 -791.3 760.5 936.9\" width=\"1.766ex\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\">\n<title id=\"MathJax-SVG-18-Title\">C</title>\n<defs aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<path d=\"M50 252Q50 367 117 473T286 641T490 704Q580 704 633 653Q642 643 648 636T656 626L657 623Q660 623 684 649Q691 655 699 663T715 679T725 690L740 705H746Q760 705 760 698Q760 694 728 561Q692 422 692 421Q690 416 687 415T669 413H653Q647 419 647 422Q647 423 648 429T650 449T651 481Q651 552 619 605T510 659Q484 659 454 652T382 628T299 572T226 479Q194 422 175 346T156 222Q156 108 232 58Q280 24 350 24Q441 24 512 92T606 240Q610 253 612 255T628 257Q648 257 648 248Q648 243 647 239Q618 132 523 55T319 -22Q206 -22 128 53T50 252Z\" id=\"E18-MJMATHI-43\" stroke-width=\"1\"></path>\n</defs>\n<g aria-hidden=\"true\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)\">\n<use x=\"0\" xlink:href=\"#E18-MJMATHI-43\" y=\"0\"></use>\n</g>\n</svg></span> equals the amount of water flowing out through <span class=\"mjpage\"><svg aria-labelledby=\"MathJax-SVG-19-Title\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"2.176ex\" role=\"img\" style=\"vertical-align: -0.338ex;\" viewbox=\"0 -791.3 1039 936.9\" width=\"2.413ex\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\">\n<title id=\"MathJax-SVG-19-Title\">C.</title>\n<defs aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<path d=\"M50 252Q50 367 117 473T286 641T490 704Q580 704 633 653Q642 643 648 636T656 626L657 623Q660 623 684 649Q691 655 699 663T715 679T725 690L740 705H746Q760 705 760 698Q760 694 728 561Q692 422 692 421Q690 416 687 415T669 413H653Q647 419 647 422Q647 423 648 429T650 449T651 481Q651 552 619 605T510 659Q484 659 454 652T382 628T299 572T226 479Q194 422 175 346T156 222Q156 108 232 58Q280 24 350 24Q441 24 512 92T606 240Q610 253 612 255T628 257Q648 257 648 248Q648 243 647 239Q618 132 523 55T319 -22Q206 -22 128 53T50 252Z\" id=\"E19-MJMATHI-43\" stroke-width=\"1\"></path>\n<path d=\"M78 60Q78 84 95 102T138 120Q162 120 180 104T199 61Q199 36 182 18T139 0T96 17T78 60Z\" id=\"E19-MJMAIN-2E\" stroke-width=\"1\"></path>\n</defs>\n<g aria-hidden=\"true\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)\">\n<use x=\"0\" xlink:href=\"#E19-MJMATHI-43\" y=\"0\"></use>\n<use x=\"760\" xlink:href=\"#E19-MJMAIN-2E\" y=\"0\"></use>\n</g>\n</svg></span></p>\n<div class=\"graphic\" id=\"graphic-5ee9cd595acfac4ed2ff55d6f5e31338\"><img src=\"/graphics/5ee9cd595acfac4ed2ff55d6f5e31338\"/></div>\nThe following two vector fields also have a zero flux across <span class=\"mjpage\"><svg aria-labelledby=\"MathJax-SVG-20-Title\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"2.176ex\" role=\"img\" style=\"vertical-align: -0.338ex;\" viewbox=\"0 -791.3 760.5 936.9\" width=\"1.766ex\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\">\n<title id=\"MathJax-SVG-20-Title\">C</title>\n<defs aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<path d=\"M50 252Q50 367 117 473T286 641T490 704Q580 704 633 653Q642 643 648 636T656 626L657 623Q660 623 684 649Q691 655 699 663T715 679T725 690L740 705H746Q760 705 760 698Q760 694 728 561Q692 422 692 421Q690 416 687 415T669 413H653Q647 419 647 422Q647 423 648 429T650 449T651 481Q651 552 619 605T510 659Q484 659 454 652T382 628T299 572T226 479Q194 422 175 346T156 222Q156 108 232 58Q280 24 350 24Q441 24 512 92T606 240Q610 253 612 255T628 257Q648 257 648 248Q648 243 647 239Q618 132 523 55T319 -22Q206 -22 128 53T50 252Z\" id=\"E20-MJMATHI-43\" stroke-width=\"1\"></path>\n</defs>\n<g aria-hidden=\"true\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)\">\n<use x=\"0\" xlink:href=\"#E20-MJMATHI-43\" y=\"0\"></use>\n</g>\n</svg></span> because the water flow is tangential to <span class=\"mjpage\"><svg aria-labelledby=\"MathJax-SVG-21-Title\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"2.176ex\" role=\"img\" style=\"vertical-align: -0.338ex;\" viewbox=\"0 -791.3 760.5 936.9\" width=\"1.766ex\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\">\n<title id=\"MathJax-SVG-21-Title\">C</title>\n<defs aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<path d=\"M50 252Q50 367 117 473T286 641T490 704Q580 704 633 653Q642 643 648 636T656 626L657 623Q660 623 684 649Q691 655 699 663T715 679T725 690L740 705H746Q760 705 760 698Q760 694 728 561Q692 422 692 421Q690 416 687 415T669 413H653Q647 419 647 422Q647 423 648 429T650 449T651 481Q651 552 619 605T510 659Q484 659 454 652T382 628T299 572T226 479Q194 422 175 346T156 222Q156 108 232 58Q280 24 350 24Q441 24 512 92T606 240Q610 253 612 255T628 257Q648 257 648 248Q648 243 647 239Q618 132 523 55T319 -22Q206 -22 128 53T50 252Z\" id=\"E21-MJMATHI-43\" stroke-width=\"1\"></path>\n</defs>\n<g aria-hidden=\"true\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)\">\n<use x=\"0\" xlink:href=\"#E21-MJMATHI-43\" y=\"0\"></use>\n</g>\n</svg></span> at every point along <span class=\"mjpage\"><svg aria-labelledby=\"MathJax-SVG-22-Title\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"2.176ex\" role=\"img\" style=\"vertical-align: -0.338ex;\" viewbox=\"0 -791.3 1039 936.9\" width=\"2.413ex\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\">\n<title id=\"MathJax-SVG-22-Title\">C.</title>\n<defs aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<path d=\"M50 252Q50 367 117 473T286 641T490 704Q580 704 633 653Q642 643 648 636T656 626L657 623Q660 623 684 649Q691 655 699 663T715 679T725 690L740 705H746Q760 705 760 698Q760 694 728 561Q692 422 692 421Q690 416 687 415T669 413H653Q647 419 647 422Q647 423 648 429T650 449T651 481Q651 552 619 605T510 659Q484 659 454 652T382 628T299 572T226 479Q194 422 175 346T156 222Q156 108 232 58Q280 24 350 24Q441 24 512 92T606 240Q610 253 612 255T628 257Q648 257 648 248Q648 243 647 239Q618 132 523 55T319 -22Q206 -22 128 53T50 252Z\" id=\"E22-MJMATHI-43\" stroke-width=\"1\"></path>\n<path d=\"M78 60Q78 84 95 102T138 120Q162 120 180 104T199 61Q199 36 182 18T139 0T96 17T78 60Z\" id=\"E22-MJMAIN-2E\" stroke-width=\"1\"></path>\n</defs>\n<g aria-hidden=\"true\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)\">\n<use x=\"0\" xlink:href=\"#E22-MJMATHI-43\" y=\"0\"></use>\n<use x=\"760\" xlink:href=\"#E22-MJMAIN-2E\" y=\"0\"></use>\n</g>\n</svg></span>\n<div class=\"graphic\" id=\"graphic-c42545d02cf09e50de1127972d6f188a\"><img src=\"/graphics/c42545d02cf09e50de1127972d6f188a\"/></div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>"
      },
      {
        "math_academy_id": 184956,
        "type": "tutorial",
        "content_id": 9522,
        "title": "Constructing an Integral Formula for the Flux",
        "position": 1,
        "dom_id": "step-184956",
        "html": "<div class=\"step\" contentid=\"9522\" id=\"step-184956\" stepid=\"184956\" steptype=\"tutorial\" style=\"display: block\">\n<div class=\"stepHeader\">\n<div class=\"stepName\">\n<a class=\"stepAnchor\" id=\"stepAnchor-184956\" name=\"step-2\">Constructing an Integral Formula for the Flux</a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"helpButton\" stepid=\"184956\">?</div>\n</div>\n<style type=\"text/css\">\n                            .mjpage .MJX-monospace {\n                            font-family: monospace\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage .MJX-sans-serif {\n                            font-family: sans-serif\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage {\n                            display: inline;\n                            font-style: normal;\n                            font-weight: normal;\n                            line-height: normal;\n                            font-size: 100%;\n                            font-size-adjust: none;\n                            text-indent: 0;\n                            text-align: left;\n                            text-transform: none;\n                            letter-spacing: normal;\n                            word-spacing: normal;\n                            word-wrap: normal;\n                            white-space: nowrap;\n                            float: none;\n                            direction: ltr;\n                            max-width: none;\n                            max-height: none;\n                            min-width: 0;\n                            min-height: 0;\n                            border: 0;\n                            padding: 0;\n                            margin: 0\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage * {\n                            transition: none;\n                            -webkit-transition: none;\n                            -moz-transition: none;\n                   