\"3486\" xlink:href=\"#E2-MJMAIN-222A\" y=\"0\"></use>\n<g transform=\"translate(4375,0)\">\n<use x=\"0\" xlink:href=\"#E2-MJMATHI-43\" y=\"0\"></use>\n<use transform=\"scale(0.707)\" x=\"1011\" xlink:href=\"#E2-MJMAIN-32\" y=\"-213\"></use>\n</g>\n<use x=\"5767\" xlink:href=\"#E2-MJMAIN-222A\" y=\"0\"></use>\n<use x=\"6657\" xlink:href=\"#E2-MJMAIN-22EF\" y=\"0\"></use>\n<use x=\"8051\" xlink:href=\"#E2-MJMAIN-222A\" y=\"0\"></use>\n<g transform=\"translate(8941,0)\">\n<use x=\"0\" xlink:href=\"#E2-MJMATHI-43\" y=\"0\"></use>\n<use transform=\"scale(0.707)\" x=\"1011\" xlink:href=\"#E2-MJMATHI-6E\" y=\"-213\"></use>\n</g>\n</g>\n</svg></span> is piecewise smooth, we have to calculate the flux of <span class=\"mjpage\"><svg aria-labelledby=\"MathJax-SVG-3-Title\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"2.176ex\" role=\"img\" style=\"vertical-align: -0.338ex;\" viewbox=\"0 -791.3 724.5 936.9\" width=\"1.683ex\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\">\n<title id=\"MathJax-SVG-3-Title\">\\mathbf F</title>\n<defs aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<path d=\"M425 0L228 3Q63 3 51 0H39V62H147V618H39V680H644V676Q647 670 659 552T675 428V424H613Q613 433 605 477Q599 511 589 535T562 574T530 599T488 612T441 617T387 618H368H304V371H333Q389 373 411 390T437 468V488H499V192H437V212Q436 244 430 263T408 292T378 305T333 309H304V62H439V0H425Z\" id=\"E3-MJMAINB-46\" stroke-width=\"1\"></path>\n</defs>\n<g aria-hidden=\"true\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)\">\n<use x=\"0\" xlink:href=\"#E3-MJMAINB-46\" y=\"0\"></use>\n</g>\n</svg></span> over each smooth face. That is,</p>\n<p><span class=\"mjpage mjpage__block\"><svg aria-labelledby=\"MathJax-SVG-4-Title\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"7.676ex\" role=\"img\" style=\"vertical-align: -4.338ex; margin-left: -0.031ex;\" viewbox=\"-13.1 -1437.2 24252.4 3304.9\" width=\"56.328ex\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\">\n<title id=\"MathJax-SVG-4-Title\">\n \\oint\\limits_C \\mathbf F \\cdot \\mathbf{n} \\: \\textrm{d}s  =  \\int\\limits_{C_1} \\mathbf F \\cdot \\mathbf{n} \\: \\textrm{d}s + \\int\\limits_{C_2} \\mathbf F \\cdot \\mathbf{n} \\: \\textrm{d}s\n+ \\cdots +\n\\int\\limits_{C_n} \\mathbf F \\cdot \\mathbf{n} \\: \\textrm{d}s,\n</title>\n<defs aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<path d=\"M114 -798Q132 -824 165 -824H167Q195 -824 223 -764T275 -600T320 -391T362 -164Q365 -143 367 -133Q382 -52 390 2Q314 40 276 99Q230 167 230 249Q230 363 305 436T484 519H494L503 563Q587 939 632 1087T727 1298Q774 1360 828 1360Q884 1360 912 1325T944 1245Q944 1220 932 1205T909 1186T887 1183Q866 1183 849 1198T832 1239Q832 1287 885 1296L882 1300Q879 1303 874 1307T866 1313Q851 1323 833 1323Q766 1323 688 929Q662 811 610 496Q770 416 770 249Q770 147 701 68T516 -21H506L497 -65Q407 -464 357 -623T237 -837Q203 -862 165 -862Q125 -862 92 -831T55 -746Q55 -711 74 -698T112 -685Q133 -685 150 -700T167 -741Q167 -789 114 -798ZM480 478Q460 478 435 470T380 444T327 401T287 335T271 249Q271 124 375 56L397 43L431 223L485 478H480ZM519 20Q545 20 578 33T647 72T706 144T730 249Q730 383 603 455Q603 454 597 421T582 343T569 276Q516 22 515 20H519Z\" id=\"E4-MJSZ2-222E\" stroke-width=\"1\"></path>\n<path d=\"M50 252Q50 367 117 473T286 641T490 704Q580 704 633 653Q642 643 648 636T656 626L657 623Q660 623 684 649Q691 655 699 663T715 679T725 690L740 705H746Q760 705 760 698Q760 694 728 561Q692 422 692 421Q690 416 687 415T669 413H653Q647 419 647 422Q647 423 648 429T650 449T651 481Q651 552 619 605T510 659Q484 659 454 652T382 628T299 572T226 479Q194 422 175 346T156 222Q156 108 232 58Q280 24 350 24Q441 24 512 92T606 240Q610 253 612 255T628 257Q648 257 648 248Q648 243 647 239Q618 132 523 55T319 -22Q206 -22 128 53T50 252Z\" id=\"E4-MJMATHI-43\" stroke-width=\"1\"></path>\n<path d=\"M425 0L228 3Q63 3 51 0H39V62H147V618H39V680H644V676Q647 670 659 552T675 428V424H613Q613 433 605 477Q599 511 589 535T562 574T530 599T488 612T441 617T387 618H368H304V371H333